<blockquote class="uncited"><div><br>Try resetting the settings. <br><br>If that doesn't work,  Try going back to a much older version e.g. the stable release from December 2023, as that would still have GPS support<br><br>If that still doesn't work, then perhaps you have an intermittent fault with the GPS hardware</div></blockquote>Thanks for the quick reply.  I have reset the settings.  I've tried several different previous versions, including the December '23 stable version.  Same result "GPS: None"<br><br>Intermittent fault with the GPS hardware that only shows up after a year of working fine?  Possible, I suppose, but seems unlikely.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5571">N0JYZ</a> — Sat Jan 04, 2025 11:39 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
